  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "{\"schema_version\":\"optomind.writing_evidence.payload.v1\",\"book_sha256\":\"3662038f6f241a48979bc8f9e30c8382776def734fcaa4cdddb82858d6cb6322\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"research_question\":\"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\",\"review_argument\":\"肠道微生物组通过分类学特征、代谢产物及免疫通路调节实体瘤患者对 ICI 的临床疗效，但证据强度因肿瘤类型、研究设计及干预策略而异。观察性关联证据在黑色素瘤中最强，NSCLC 和 RCC 次之，但关联不等于因果。机制证据主要来自动物模型，人类验证有限，特别是肿瘤微环境内代谢物浓度数据缺失（如肌苷仅有血浆数据）。干预策略在初治人群中显示希望（FMT-LUMINate ORR 75-80%），但在难治人群中效果有限（MITRIC ORR 0%），且安全性受 ICI 方案调节（Prevotella 相关心肌炎仅在双 ICI 背景下出现）。目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用，未来研究需解决标准化、因果推断及人群分层问题。\",\"user_request\":\"\",\"target_reader\":\"\",\"review_scope\":{\"statement\":\"本综述聚焦于实体瘤（黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、结直肠癌等）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4 抑制剂）治疗期间，肠道微生物组对治疗疗效（ORR、PFS、OS）及毒性（irAEs）的调节作用。涵盖观察性关联证据（区分回顾性与前瞻性队列）、因果机制解析（免疫细胞、分子通路、代谢物）、外部干扰因素（抗生素、PPI、饮食）及微生物干预策略（FMT、益生菌、工程菌）的临床试验数据。明确排除血液系统恶性肿瘤及非免疫治疗背景下的微生物组研究（除非用于机制对比）。严格区分肠道微生物组与肿瘤内微生物组的作用边界。证据等级标注明确：观察性关联不推断因果，干预试验区分 I/II 期与 III 期，代谢物数据区分血浆与肿瘤组织浓度。\"},\"missing_original_context_fields\":[\"user_request\",\"target_reader\"],\"editable_task_ids\":[\"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P01\",\"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P02\",\"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P03\",\"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P01\",\"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P02\",\"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P03\",\"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P01\",\"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P02\",\"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P03\",\"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P01\",\"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P02\",\"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P03\",\"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_T01\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U01::Ch2_U01_P01\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U01::Ch2_U01_P02\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U01::Ch2_U01_P03\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U02::Ch2_U02_P01\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U02::Ch2_U02_P02\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U03::Ch2_U03_P01\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U03::Ch2_U03_P02\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U03::Ch2_U03_P03\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U03::Ch2_U03_P04\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U04::Ch2_U04_P01\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U04::Ch2_U04_P02\",\"Ch2::Ch2_U04::Ch2_U04_T01\",\"Ch3::U3_1::U3_1_P01\",\"Ch3::U3_1::U3_1_P02\",\"Ch3::U3_1::U3_1_P03\",\"Ch3::U3_1::U3_1_P04\",\"Ch3::U3_2::U3_2_P01\",\"Ch3::U3_2::U3_2_P02\",\"Ch3::